  "q": "<p>After deployment, you find that 12% of extractions contain semantic errors that pass JSON schema validation (e.g., a duration like \"30 minutes\" incorrectly placed in an ingredient quantity field). Human reviewers have capacity to check only 20% of extractions.</p> <p>Which approach most effectively allocates reviewer attention?</p>",
