  "q": "<p>Your extraction pipeline processes invoices and extracts line items, tax amounts, and grand totals. You discover that 8% of documents have extracted line item amounts that don't sum to the extracted grand total—the downstream accounting system has been detecting mismatches.</p> <p>What's the most effective improvement?</p>",
