  "q": "<p>Production monitoring shows the research phase takes longer than expected. </p><p>Analysis reveals the coordinator invokes the web search subagent, then invokes the document analysis subagent and waits again. </p><p>These tasks are independent—neither requires the other's output. </p><p>What is the most effective way to run these subagents concurrently?</p>",
