  "q": "<p>Introduction monitoring shows the research phase takes longer than expected. Analysis reveals the coordinator invokes the web search subagent, waits for its response, then invokes the document analysis subagent and waits again. These tasks are independent - neither requires the other's output. </p><p>How should you modify the system to run these subagents concurrently?</p>",
